{"sha": "4ac47c81cb89cc02bdf2398f257533d38ebe3f8f2c249a554ca94106040d64fc", "body": ["\\begin{method}[计算符号差：三种途径]\\label{met:b2:quadratic:signature}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{高斯约化}（总是可行，手算最快）：依次配方，", "        无平方项可配时用情形 2；", "        统计符号。检验所得的线性型", "        线性无关 --- 线性型个数少于变量则意味着有", "        核（见\\cref{ex:b2:quadratic:degenerate}）。", "  \\item \\emph{顺序主子式}（用于判别正定性）：", "        所有 $\\Delta_k > 0$ 当且仅当正定", "        （见\\cref{exo:b2:quadratic:8}）；主元", "        $\\Delta_k/\\Delta_{k-1}$ 甚至给出高斯", "        系数（周末问题）。若存在某个", "        $\\Delta_k = 0$，则此法悄然失效：改用途径 1。", "  \\item \\emph{特征值}（信息量最大，计算代价最高）：", "        谱的符号", "        （见\\cref{cor:b2:quadratic:principalaxes}）；还给出主轴，", "        以及 $q$ 在", "        单位球面上的极值。若无论如何都需要特征结构，", "        则优先采用此法。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{谱定理}", "", "现设 $E$ 为欧氏空间（内积 $\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$，", "见本科一年级分册）。", "", "\\begin{definition}[伴随；对称自同态]\\label{def:b2:quadratic:adjoint}", "对 $u \\in \\mathcal{L}(E)$，其\\emph{伴随}\\index{伴随}", "$u^*$ 是唯一满足下式的自同态：", "\\[", "\\langle u(x), y\\rangle = \\langle x, u^*(y)\\rangle", "\\qquad (x, y \\in E);", "\\]", "在标准正交基下，$\\operatorname{Mat}(u^*) =", "\\operatorname{Mat}(u)^{\\mathsf T}$。$u$ 称为", "\\emph{对称自同态}\\index{对称自同态}（自伴）", "当 $u^* = u$ 时 --- 等价地，其在标准正交基下的矩阵", "对称。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proof}[伴随的存在与唯一性]", "固定 $y$，$x \\mapsto \\langle u(x), y\\rangle$ 是一个", "线性型，故（有限维）可写为 $\\langle x,", "z_y\\rangle$ 的形式，其中 $z_y$ 唯一 --- 映射 $y \\mapsto z_y =:", "u^*(y)$ 的线性性由唯一性得出。矩阵的对应：", "$\\langle u(e_i), e_j\\rangle$ 按两种方式读出。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[伴随依赖于内积]\\label{ex:b2:quadratic:weightedadjoint}", "在 $\\R^2$ 上取\\emph{加权}内积 $\\langle x,", "y\\rangle_D = x_1y_1 + 2x_2y_2$（矩阵 $D =", "\\operatorname{diag}(1,2)$），$u$ 在标准基下的矩阵为 $A =", "\\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1\\\\ 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}$。", "由 $\\langle u(x), y\\rangle_D = (Ax)^{\\mathsf T}Dy =", "x^{\\mathsf T}(A^{\\mathsf T}D)y$，而 $\\langle x, u^*(y)\\rangle_D", "= x^{\\mathsf T}(DA^*)y$，于是伴随的矩阵为", "\\[", "A^* = D^{-1}A^{\\mathsf T}D", "= \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0\\\\ 0 & \\tfrac12\\end{pmatrix}", "\\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 0\\\\ 1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}", "\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0\\\\ 0 & 2\\end{pmatrix}", "= \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 0\\\\ \\tfrac12 & 0\\end{pmatrix}", "\\neq A^{\\mathsf T} .", "\\]", "验证：取 $x = (1,0)$，$y = (0,1)$：", "\\[", "\\langle u(x), y\\rangle_D = \\langle (0,0), y\\rangle_D = 0,", "\\quad", "\\langle x, u^*(y)\\rangle_D", "= \\langle(1,0), (0,\\tfrac12)\\rangle_D = 0 ;", "\\]", "取 $x = (0,1)$，$y = (1,0)$：", "\\[", "\\langle u(x), y\\rangle_D = \\langle(1,0),(1,0)\\rangle_D = 1,", "\\quad", "\\langle x, u^*(y)\\rangle_D =", "\\langle(0,1),(0,\\tfrac12)\\rangle_D = 1 .", "\\] 要点：“$\\operatorname{Mat}(u^*)", "= \\operatorname{Mat}(u)^{\\mathsf T}$”只是关于", "\\emph{标准正交}基的论断；一般而言，度量 $D$", "起作用，正如周末问题中的", "同时化简那样。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[谱定理]\\label{thm:b2:quadratic:spectral}", "设 $u$ 为欧氏空间 $E$ 上的对称自同态，则", "$E$ 有\\emph{由 $u$ 的特征向量构成的标准正交基}；所有", "特征值均为实数，且不同特征值的特征子空间", "相互正交。矩阵形式：每个实对称矩阵 $A$ 可写为", "\\[", "A = P\\,D\\,P^{\\mathsf T},", "\\qquad P \\text{ 正交 } (P^{\\mathsf T} P = I),\\ D", "\\text{ 为对角阵 }.\\index{谱定理}", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "\\emph{存在特征向量。}函数 $x \\mapsto \\langle u(x),", "x\\rangle$ 在单位球面 $S$（$E$ 的）上连续，该球面", "是紧的（有限维，见\\cref{thm:b2:nvs:finitedim}），于是", "其最大值 $\\lambda$ 在某点 $a \\in S$ 处取到。断言 $u(a) = \\lambda", "a$。对任意满足 $y \\perp a$、$\\norm y = 1$ 的向量与任意 $t \\in \\R$，", "则 $x_t = \\frac{a + ty}{\\sqrt{1 + t^2}}$ 在 $S$ 上", "（$\\norm{a + ty}^2 = 1 + t^2$，由勾股定理）；展开", "被最大化的函数，", "\\[", "g(t) = \\langle u(x_t), x_t\\rangle", "= \\frac{\\langle u(a), a\\rangle + 2t\\langle u(a), y\\rangle +", "t^2\\langle u(y), y\\rangle}{1 + t^2}", "\\]", "（$u$ 的对称性合并了两个交叉项：$\\langle u(a),", "y\\rangle = \\langle a, u(y)\\rangle = \\langle u(y), a\\rangle$）。", "$g$ 是关于 $t$ 的可微函数，且在 $t =", "0$ 处取最大值。由商的求导法则，在 $0$ 处给出", "\\[", "g'(0) = \\frac{2\\langle u(a), y\\rangle\\cdot 1 - \\langle u(a),", "a\\rangle\\cdot 0}{1} = 2\\langle u(a), y\\rangle = 0 .", "\\]", "于是 $u(a)$ 正交于整个超平面 $a^\\perp$：$u(a)", "\\in (a^{\\perp})^{\\perp} = \\R a$，即 $u(a) = \\mu a$；且 $\\mu =", "\\langle u(a), a\\rangle = \\lambda$。", ""]}